# Animation Kuralları

Önce oku: `docs/02_DESIGN/MOTION_GUIDELINES.md`, `docs/02_DESIGN/DESIGN_TOKENS.md`

## Performance

- Min 60 FPS, hedef 120 FPS; frame budget 16ms
- Max süreler: UI 500ms, page transition 400ms, micro interaction 200ms
- React Native Reanimated kullan; layout thrashing ve gereksiz rerender'dan kaçın

## Token kullanımı

Hardcoded duration/easing yasak. Örnekler:
- `motion.duration.fast` (150ms), `motion.duration.normal` (220ms)
- `motion.easing.standard`, `motion.spring.soft`

## Navigation

- Push: 300ms slide left + fade
- Pop: 250ms
- Modal: 280ms fade backdrop + slide up
- Bottom sheet: spring, velocity-aware, snap 25/50/75/100%
- Navigation'da elastic/bounce kullanma

## Reduced Motion

Parallax, particles, büyük scale, complex shared elements devre dışı → fade/opacity/küçük translation

## Kategoriler

Navigation, Feedback, Content, Loading (skeleton tercih), System, Ambient (subtle, reduced motion'da kapalı)

Her animasyon bir amaca hizmet etmeli: relationship, context, feedback, attention, cognitive load.
